sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Import Page
  participant API as /api/import
  participant Imp as Importer
  participant Loc as ExcelLocator
  participant Norm as Normalizer
  participant DB as SQLite
  User->>UI: 选择目录/文件
  UI->>API: POST 文件列表
  API->>Imp: import_files(paths)
  loop 每个 .xlsx（跳过 ~$ / 主数据）
    Imp->>Loc: locate_data_sheet(wb)
    Loc-->>Imp: (sheet, header_row, column_map, version)
    Imp->>Norm: parse_month(filename)
    Norm-->>Imp: YYYY-MM
    Imp->>Imp: resolve_idempotency(source_file) → skip/overwrite/copy
    Imp->>Norm: normalize 每行(rid/pid/name)
    Imp->>Imp: 行 hash → 标记 is_duplicate
    Imp->>Imp: 检测 datetime actuals → is_anomaly
    Imp->>DB: 批量 INSERT import_batch + timesheet_record
  end
  Imp-->>API: ImportReport(新增行/跳过/标记)
  API-->>UI: 报告 + 跳转质量面板

---

sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Query Page
  participant API as /api/query
  participant Agg as Aggregator
  participant Exc as Exclusion
  participant DB as SQLite
  User->>UI: 项目号/人员 + 区间 + 过滤
  UI->>API: POST filter
  API->>Agg: aggregate_three_layer(filter)
  Agg->>Exc: 载入 active exclusions
  Agg->>DB: 层1 总计 WHERE filter AND not excluded
  Agg->>DB: 层2 按月 GROUP BY report_month
  Agg->>DB: 层3 按人 GROUP BY resource_id_norm
  Agg->>DB: WBS 下一级 drill
  Agg-->>API: {total, by_month, by_person, wbs}
  API-->>UI: 三层渲染 + 图表数据

---

sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Result Page
  participant API as /api/export
  participant Exp as Exporter
  participant Agg as Aggregator
  participant DB as SQLite
  User->>UI: 点击导出 Excel/CSV
  UI->>API: POST(filter, format, lang)
  API->>Agg: 复用相同 filter 取明细行
  Agg->>DB: SELECT 明细 WHERE filter
  Agg-->>Exp: rows
  Exp->>Exp: 套用双语表头映射(config.BILINGUAL)
  Exp->>DB: 写 xlsx(openpyxl) / csv
  Exp-->>API: file path
  API-->>UI: 下载链接
